                  %mi X
                  %msub
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} }
                    %mi i
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \{k^{-1} \iota_i \colon U_i \to \coprod_i U_i \cong X\}_i
            is jointly epic, so it contains a regular epi
            = succeed "." do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
